Stop sending Cookie/Authorization/Proxy-Authorization headers given with
-H once a redirect leaves the origin; adds --location-trusted.
https://github.com/axel-download-accelerator/axel/issues/409
https://github.com/axel-download-accelerator/axel/commit/043bc3ed8d
https://github.com/axel-download-accelerator/axel/commit/a7ff24ac1c
PLD change: a different port is a different origin (upstream keeps the
headers; curl drops them since CVE-2022-27776). text.c adapted to 2.17.14;
help text left alone to keep its translations; axel.1 patched directly,
txt2man is not available at build time.
