+++ axel-2.17.14/doc/axel.1
@@ -47,6 +47,15 @@ Specify an alternative number of redirections to follow when connecting to the
 server (default is 20).
 .TP
 .B
+\fB--location-trusted\fP
+Keep sending the headers that carry credentials after a redirect has led to a
+host other than the one asked for. A Cookie, Authorization or Proxy-Authorization
+header given with \fB--header\fP is meant for the host named on the command line, so it
+is dropped once a redirect leaves that host or port, or leaves TLS behind
+(the http to https upgrade on the default ports keeps it). Use this only
+when every host the download may be sent to is as trusted as the first one.
+.TP
